  "description": "Operating Area: Southern Andaman Seas (Phuket and Surroundings, Mu Ko Similan Marine Park, Phang Nga Bay and Krabi, Phi Phi Islands, Racha Islands, Koh Lipe and Butang Archipelago, Koh Samui, Koh Chang, Krabi National Park)\n\nStep aboard Mami Wata, a remarkable 1954 wooden Halvorsen boat with a length of 15 meters. This vintage vessel is a true gem, perfect for unforgettable excursions such as sunset cruises and day trips around the captivating Phuket region. This vintage vessel is the epitome of elegance and is perfectly suited for unforgettable excursions, such as sunset cruises and day trips around the breathtaking Phuket region. With its timeless design, Mami Wata exudes a classic charm that will capture the hearts of all who step on board.\nWhether you're embarking on an overnight charter or a day trip, this exceptional boat accommodates up to 4 guests in 2 cabins, ensuring a cozy and comfortable experience. During day trips, Mami Wata can host up to 8 guests, allowing you to share the magic with your loved ones.\n",
